<title>NETHERLANDS: BOLSWESSANEN 1996 BREAKDOWN BY SECTOR.</title>
<headline>BOLSWESSANEN 1996 BREAKDOWN BY SECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Breakdown by sector of</p>
<p>Koninklijke BolsWessanen NV's 1996 full-year results.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Turnover</p>
<p>     - Dairy (billion)			    2.25   vs   2.08</p>
<p>     - Convenience food, cereals		 708   vs    796</p>
<p>     - Natural and specialty foods (bln)    1.03   vs   0.86</p>
<p>     - Spirits and wines			   709   vs    895</p>
<p>     - Total (billion)			    4.69   vs   4.63</p>
<p>Operating profit</p>
<p>     - Dairy					 126.2   vs  124.2</p>
<p>     - Convenience food, cereals		37.1   vs   59.3</p>
<p>     - Natural and specialty foods	    42.6   vs   34.2</p>
<p>     - Spirits and wines			  45.4   vs   55.2</p>
<p>     - Other revenue				11.0   vs   15.7</p>
<p>     - Total					 262.3   vs  288.6</p>
